- $f_{ij}^{bundle}$: bonus_cents for each (item_a, item_b) in [file_1_view_0]
- $Q$: all (item_a, item_b) in [file_5_view_0]
- $P$: all (item_ref, prerequisite_ref) in [file_10_view_0]

**Variable Domains**
